# Local-only operational notes, by category (added 2026-09-03).
# A second clone of this repo was found holding 26 untracked files of this
# shape -- incident RCAs, triage write-ups, session handoffs, meeting
# material, and some unrelated side projects. None were gitignored, so a
# careless `git add -A` would have staged the lot. That is not hypothetical
# here: progress.md was once committed to public GitHub with a real
# Tailscale IP in it, and cost a history rewrite and force-push to remove.
# Each pattern below was checked against `git ls-files` first -- none
# shadows a tracked file. Keep it that way when extending this list.
docs/rca-*
docs/triage-*
docs/session-handoff-*
docs/*agenda*
docs/*briefing*
docs/*meeting*
docs/bpc-*
docs/wsj-*
docs/dk-paywall*
*.user.js

# Scanner scratch output and in-flight review notes
scratchpad_out/
fix-review-primer.md
static_analysis_semgrep_1/
